OL,3,ACrashed RAF jet steered to 'avoid
OL,4,Abuilt-up areas' before pilots ejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trainee and an experienced
OL,7,Fprofessional, who parachuted out of
OL,8,Ftheir plane moments before it crashed,
OL,9,Fare expected to make a full recovery
OL,10,Fafter they were treated for minor
OL,11,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
