OL,3,AWhite House restores access to media
OL,4,Aoutlets banned by Trump after judge's
OL,5,Aorder
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump initially said he barred the
OL,8,Foutlets because of "fake news". The
OL,9,FWhite House later cited national
OL,10,Fsecurity.
OL,12,FBut in his overnight ruling, Judge
OL,13,FTimothy Kelly cast doubt on the claim
OL,14,Fabout national security concerns.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
